@startuml
title EXTERNAL_V2 sale - actual receipt and trusted demo transport
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
actor Buyer
actor Seller
actor Inspector
actor Admin
participant FastAPI as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Private inspection Storage" as Storage
participant "Lifecycle worker" as Worker
Buyer -> API : quote / create / simulated payment
API -> DB : EXTERNAL_V2 + immutable quote / Payment / Receipt / HELD
Seller -> API : validated return address / carrier / tracking TO_CENTER
API -> DB : freeze Seller snapshot / TO_CENTER
Inspector -> API : canonical actual center receive / start / inspection evidence
API -> Storage : authorized private inspection photos
Inspector -> API : final PASS or MINOR_ISSUE
API -> DB : atomic result + certificate + availability +72h
Buyer -> API : CONFIRM strictly before result deadline
API -> DB : locked fresh DB clock / one Buyer decision
Inspector -> API : carrier / tracking final dispatch
API -> DB : server-derived TO_BUYER / frozen Buyer destination
opt Explicitly enabled demo transport event
  Admin -> API : trusted DELIVERED identity / shipment / leg
  API -> DB : immutable ADMIN_DEMO event at server time
  API -> DB : independent receipt deadline = event time +72h
end
alt Actual Buyer receipt after dispatch
  Buyer -> API : confirm-receipt (event may still be absent)
  API -> DB : locked fresh clock / optional existing deadline
  API -> DB : actual recipient + atomic one RELEASE / COMPLETED / SOLD
else Eligible AUTO with trusted event and no report
  Worker -> DB : bounded no-HTTP scan after receipt deadline
  Worker -> DB : same service / one AUTO RELEASE
end
API --> Buyer : original charged receipt + committed settlement
API --> Seller : payout1140 / commission60 on item1200
Buyer -> API : one completed-Order seller review
API -> DB : persisted C review
note over API,DB
  Missing report after dispatch blocks later AUTO.
  Tracking alone starts neither timer; no new Courier account/photo.
  Shared providers, UI/device and deployed scheduler are separate gates.
end note
@enduml
